        "original_id": "d2b88a3e-3a97-5d00-8f22-0512e222767d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Projects: Killer World Tour, World Wide Blitz Tour, Maiden Japan\n- Companies: Iron Maiden, Judas Priest, UFO\n- Places: North America, Japan\n\nFacts:\n- Killer World Tour was Iron Maiden's first world tour.\n- During Killer World Tour, Iron Maiden played their debut shows in North America.\n- In North America, Iron Maiden supported Judas Priest on the World Wide Blitz Tour and supported UFO on select dates.\n- During Killer World Tour, Iron Maiden also played in Japan.\n- In Japan, Iron Maiden recorded the live release \"Maiden Japan.\"\n- Judas Priest have sold close to 50 million albums to date.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "dc628b0a-81cc-507d-bb0f-109df7c7bfc7",
        "text": "Page: Killer World Tour. Sentence: This would be the band's first world tour, including their debut shows in North America (where they supported Judas Priest on their World Wide Blitz Tour and UFO on select dates) and Japan where they recorded the live release, \"Maiden Japan\".\nPage: Judas Priest. Sentence: The band have sold close to 50 million albums to date.",
